WEBVTT

00:00:01.200 --> 00:00:05.860
A Whale's Feather

00:00:07.340 --> 00:00:12.210
It's not like you to wake up
on your own on a day off.

00:00:12.210 --> 00:00:13.510
Yeah.

00:00:13.510 --> 00:00:13.540
Road Map
Yeah.

00:00:13.540 --> 00:00:14.970
Road Map

00:00:16.010 --> 00:00:17.550
Are you going somewhere?

00:00:17.550 --> 00:00:18.710
Yeah.

00:00:18.710 --> 00:00:20.080
With someone?

00:00:20.080 --> 00:00:21.210
Yeah.

00:00:21.550 --> 00:00:22.780
Who?

00:00:23.180 --> 00:00:24.310
Yup!

00:00:30.030 --> 00:00:31.550
Leaving now!

00:00:34.130 --> 00:00:35.650
The Cub and Squirrel Story
Special Ticket

00:00:38.970 --> 00:00:40.770
Where did Shin go?

00:00:40.770 --> 00:00:41.900
On a drive.

00:00:43.140 --> 00:00:44.630
With Eiko-neechan.

00:00:52.810 --> 00:00:54.420
Sorry, did you wait long?

00:00:54.420 --> 00:00:56.250
Nope. Not at all!

00:01:22.010 --> 00:01:23.030
Toma...

00:01:42.030 --> 00:01:44.900
kanjouni aragau nayo
Don't fight back your emotions

00:01:44.900 --> 00:01:47.100
sono ashiwo tomenna
Don't ever stop

00:01:47.100 --> 00:01:51.740
taoreru nowa mada hayaize
It's too soon to fall down

00:01:51.740 --> 00:01:53.370
Breakin' through
Breakin' through

00:01:53.370 --> 00:01:55.080
uchinukeyo
Pierce through

00:01:55.080 --> 00:01:57.350
yamiwo hurihodoki
Free yourself from darkness

00:01:57.350 --> 00:02:01.440
tadoritsuku bashowa hitotsusa
There is only one destination

00:02:02.350 --> 00:02:05.320
hurueru sora
Quaking sky

00:02:07.520 --> 00:02:11.320
kazewa naniwo tsugeru
What is the wind telling me?

00:02:12.690 --> 00:02:17.100
Tadashii datoka soujanai toka
Right or wrong

00:02:17.100 --> 00:02:20.100
kudaranai ronsouwa
Nonsensical arguments

00:02:20.100 --> 00:02:22.840
kieya shinai kedo
Never go away

00:02:22.840 --> 00:02:27.240
shinjita kotowo shinjinuku koto
Believe what you believe in

00:02:27.340 --> 00:02:30.450
sono sakini bokurawa
At the end of it all

00:02:30.450 --> 00:02:33.050
hikari mitsukeru darou
We will find the light

00:02:33.050 --> 00:02:37.810
saa tokihanate ima
Now is the time to release it

00:02:38.150 --> 00:02:40.990
kanjouni aragau nayo
Don't fight back your emotions

00:02:40.990 --> 00:02:43.290
sono ashiwo tomenna
Don't ever stop

00:02:43.290 --> 00:02:47.060
taoreru nowa mada hayaize
It's too soon to fall down

00:02:47.760 --> 00:02:49.330
Breakin' through
Breakin' through

00:02:49.330 --> 00:02:51.130
uchinukeyo
Pierce through

00:02:51.130 --> 00:02:53.430
yamiwo hurihodoki
Free yourself from darkness

00:02:53.430 --> 00:02:57.600
tadoritsuku bashowa hitotsusa
There is only one destination

00:03:14.160 --> 00:03:17.290
Don't let your Persona throw you around.

00:03:17.290 --> 00:03:19.960
You're supposed to take control of your Persona.

00:03:19.960 --> 00:03:21.160
Ugh!

00:03:21.160 --> 00:03:23.670
I can't, and that's why I'm having trouble here.

00:03:23.670 --> 00:03:25.790
Can you be more specific?

00:03:26.470 --> 00:03:27.540
Listen!

00:03:27.540 --> 00:03:30.970
You know how your head starts to
hurt if you eat shaved ice too fast?

00:03:30.970 --> 00:03:35.970
Concentrate your energy into that
area, and then tighten your belly.

00:03:37.280 --> 00:03:38.680
Do you get it?

00:03:39.050 --> 00:03:42.310
It sounds too complicated
when you put it into words.

00:03:43.080 --> 00:03:45.350
Why not show me yourself?

00:03:45.350 --> 00:03:47.660
No way. Not here.

00:03:47.660 --> 00:03:49.590
Then where's a good place?

00:03:49.590 --> 00:03:51.890
It's not the place that matters!

00:03:51.890 --> 00:03:53.930
Then do it here.

00:03:53.930 --> 00:03:55.330
Just be quiet and get to it!

00:03:55.430 --> 00:03:57.800
What kind of coach is that?

00:03:57.800 --> 00:03:59.160
I don't remember becoming one.

00:04:07.280 --> 00:04:10.110
My head and my belly...

00:04:15.520 --> 00:04:17.180
Oh, fine.

00:04:27.130 --> 00:04:29.650
I can't handle this myself...

00:04:37.340 --> 00:04:39.240
Hello? Megumi-san?

00:04:39.240 --> 00:04:40.710
Sure...

00:04:41.240 --> 00:04:42.830
Where are you two?

00:04:42.910 --> 00:04:44.970
No! Tighten your armpits more!

00:04:46.880 --> 00:04:48.510
Oops, sorry.

00:04:48.880 --> 00:04:52.390
Do you know that temple near the dorms?

00:04:52.390 --> 00:04:54.220
That kind of run-down place.

00:04:54.220 --> 00:04:56.020
We're training there.

00:04:56.420 --> 00:04:59.860
I called Kanzato-kun, but he didn't pick up.

00:05:04.870 --> 00:05:07.640
Hello? Are you listening?

00:05:07.640 --> 00:05:09.400
Oh, yes. I'm listening...

00:05:09.570 --> 00:05:11.910
I think I know where it is.

00:05:11.910 --> 00:05:13.870
I'll bring some snacks, too.

00:05:17.680 --> 00:05:21.420
Assuming the plan became confidential.

00:05:21.420 --> 00:05:25.010
That's the list of organizations
most likely to take responsibility.

00:05:26.990 --> 00:05:28.760
DSI...

00:05:28.760 --> 00:05:30.990
I thought that would catch your attention, too.

00:05:32.590 --> 00:05:34.230
Isn't this place?

00:05:34.230 --> 00:05:37.360
Right. That man used to work there temporarily.

00:05:38.870 --> 00:05:42.030
There's a possibility he might
have left something there.

00:05:47.210 --> 00:05:53.010
If that man's involved, it explains
the Complex Persona I saw.

00:05:53.920 --> 00:05:55.780
We should look into this.

00:05:58.190 --> 00:05:59.950
Ryo-oniichan.

00:06:00.920 --> 00:06:03.890
Thanks. I'll get back to you again.

00:06:06.490 --> 00:06:08.260
You should at least knock.

00:06:08.260 --> 00:06:09.590
I'm sorry.

00:06:09.800 --> 00:06:12.430
You have a day off today, right?

00:06:12.970 --> 00:06:14.300
For the time being.

00:06:14.300 --> 00:06:17.000
I was planning to visit the
station in the afternoon, though.

00:06:17.410 --> 00:06:18.670
Okay...

00:06:20.140 --> 00:06:23.340
I could take you out to Bamboo for lunch.

00:06:23.340 --> 00:06:24.330
Sure.

00:06:38.630 --> 00:06:40.120
A Whale's Feather

00:06:45.000 --> 00:06:47.940
Could be from a long, long time ago.

00:06:47.940 --> 00:06:51.040
Could be from a distant yesterday.

00:06:51.040 --> 00:06:53.370
Could be about a land unknown.

00:06:53.370 --> 00:06:55.610
Could be about a familiar place.

00:06:55.610 --> 00:06:58.940
This is the story of such a time and place.

00:07:00.750 --> 00:07:04.680
Morimoto Kanaru is at a store near the dorms.

00:07:05.750 --> 00:07:08.220
She might be meeting up with Sakakiba Takuro...

00:07:08.290 --> 00:07:11.090
and Kayano Megumi, who left early this morning.

00:07:11.660 --> 00:07:15.100
Ayanagi City General Hospital

00:07:15.100 --> 00:07:15.430
Who told you they left in the morning?

00:07:15.700 --> 00:07:17.600
The dormitory manager, Inui.

00:07:18.030 --> 00:07:21.400
Um... I didn't notice he was
standing right behind me.

00:07:21.900 --> 00:07:24.210
You're too slow.

00:07:24.210 --> 00:07:27.740
No, you wouldn't have noticed, either.

00:07:27.740 --> 00:07:29.940
I was hiding pretty well, too...

00:07:31.750 --> 00:07:33.340
What? What's the matter?

00:07:35.320 --> 00:07:38.110
I got spotted again...

00:07:40.790 --> 00:07:43.420
Just come back for today, then.

00:07:43.420 --> 00:07:44.230
I'll be fine.

00:07:44.230 --> 00:07:45.460
I'll try to find a way to...

00:07:45.460 --> 00:07:47.430
Oh, she's coming this way!

00:07:53.070 --> 00:07:54.540
Hello.

00:07:54.540 --> 00:07:55.240
H-hey.

00:07:55.240 --> 00:07:56.730
We seem to run into each other a lot.

00:07:57.310 --> 00:07:59.410
I-I'm always out patrolling.

00:07:59.410 --> 00:08:02.070
You sure are good at finding me, though.

00:08:03.310 --> 00:08:07.810
I think I'd be able to find you anywhere.

00:08:10.280 --> 00:08:11.750
You're so tall.

00:08:13.120 --> 00:08:14.490
Oh yeah.

00:08:17.830 --> 00:08:19.490
Here, this is for you.

00:08:20.800 --> 00:08:22.060
Thanks...

00:08:25.300 --> 00:08:27.730
Good luck patrolling.

00:08:28.040 --> 00:08:29.670
Excuse me.

00:08:29.670 --> 00:08:29.970
Potato Chips
Excuse me.

00:08:29.970 --> 00:08:31.840
Potato Chips

00:08:34.710 --> 00:08:41.320
One by one, the people of the
village left to go... somewhere else.

00:08:41.320 --> 00:08:44.690
Everyone that the boy loved...

00:08:44.690 --> 00:08:47.880
...had all gone.

00:08:48.360 --> 00:08:54.230
But the boy's heart was still filled with happiness.

00:08:59.830 --> 00:09:00.800
Hello?

00:09:00.800 --> 00:09:02.040
Um...

00:09:02.040 --> 00:09:04.210
Is this Kanzato Jun-kun's?

00:09:04.210 --> 00:09:05.330
Yes, it is.

00:09:08.310 --> 00:09:09.800
Yamasaki-san.

00:09:10.110 --> 00:09:12.840
Hello. Sorry to bother you so suddenly.

00:09:14.880 --> 00:09:18.150
Oniichan, this is Yamasaki Mayuri-san.

00:09:18.390 --> 00:09:20.350
Shin-niichan's classmate.

00:09:20.560 --> 00:09:22.580
I'm his brother, Ryo.

00:09:24.930 --> 00:09:26.550
I'm Yamasaki Mayuri.

00:09:29.760 --> 00:09:31.490
What's going on?

00:09:31.730 --> 00:09:33.960
I wanted to thank you for that day.

00:09:34.940 --> 00:09:36.130
Thank me?

00:09:36.600 --> 00:09:37.730
You didn't have to...

00:09:38.670 --> 00:09:39.710
This.

00:09:39.710 --> 00:09:42.640
There's enough for all three of you.

00:09:42.640 --> 00:09:44.350
Whoa, it's big.

00:09:44.350 --> 00:09:45.350
Is it a cake?

00:09:45.350 --> 00:09:46.440
Beef bowls.

00:09:47.350 --> 00:09:48.610
Since it's lunch time.

00:09:50.020 --> 00:09:52.520
Well, good timing.

00:09:52.520 --> 00:09:54.460
Let's have lunch together, then.

00:09:54.460 --> 00:09:55.960
Oh, but...

00:09:55.960 --> 00:09:58.190
Shin-niichan's not here today.

00:09:58.190 --> 00:09:59.590
There's gonna be extra.

00:09:59.660 --> 00:10:00.520
But...

00:10:03.060 --> 00:10:04.930
It's fine, right, niichan?

00:10:05.730 --> 00:10:06.790
Sure.

00:10:21.220 --> 00:10:22.580
Ghost trouble?

00:10:22.850 --> 00:10:23.710
Yep.

00:10:24.020 --> 00:10:27.980
Shin-niichan, Takuro-san,
Megumi-san, Kanaru-san...

00:10:28.090 --> 00:10:30.160
and I investigated the campus at night.

00:10:30.160 --> 00:10:31.950
That's called trespassing.

00:10:34.860 --> 00:10:38.420
But I became friends with Yamasaki-san.

00:10:39.230 --> 00:10:41.340
What do you mean "but?"

00:10:41.340 --> 00:10:42.860
You're also jumping around topics.

00:10:44.710 --> 00:10:48.040
Plus, you seem too friendly with Yamasaki-san.

00:10:48.310 --> 00:10:51.640
Are you like this with other seniors at the academy?

00:10:53.880 --> 00:10:55.180
I'm sorry...

00:10:55.180 --> 00:10:56.770
No, it's okay.

00:11:10.200 --> 00:11:11.260
What is it?

00:11:12.070 --> 00:11:12.830
Nothing.

00:11:37.390 --> 00:11:38.480
Hey...

00:11:39.160 --> 00:11:41.150
We should all go to the movies together.

00:11:56.180 --> 00:11:57.910
Thanks, Kanaru.

00:11:58.250 --> 00:11:59.580
I feel alive again.

00:11:59.580 --> 00:12:02.520
You didn't have breakfast, either?

00:12:02.520 --> 00:12:03.980
Of course not.

00:12:03.980 --> 00:12:06.580
You dragged me out so early.

00:12:06.920 --> 00:12:08.890
All right, should we start again?

00:12:08.890 --> 00:12:11.130
Let me take some time to eat.

00:12:11.130 --> 00:12:13.460
I'll forget if there's too much time in between.

00:12:13.460 --> 00:12:15.760
You haven't even learned anything yet!

00:12:18.130 --> 00:12:20.500
Let's begin!

00:12:22.670 --> 00:12:24.540
Kanaru, get that side.

00:12:24.540 --> 00:12:26.700
Oh, sure... Um.

00:12:27.270 --> 00:12:28.840
Morimoto, that tickles!

00:12:28.840 --> 00:12:30.010
I'm sorry.

00:12:30.010 --> 00:12:31.030
Like this?

00:12:32.050 --> 00:12:32.910
Ouch!

00:12:32.910 --> 00:12:34.010
Get serious!

00:12:34.010 --> 00:12:35.980
Can we move toward the center a little more?

00:12:39.150 --> 00:12:40.710
I knew it.

00:12:42.020 --> 00:12:44.580
I'm glad we ran into each other again.

00:12:50.530 --> 00:12:52.970
I have something I'd like to show you, detective.

00:12:56.370 --> 00:13:00.470
The Cub and Squirrel Story

00:13:00.470 --> 00:13:01.460
I got it from my homeroom teacher.

00:13:02.040 --> 00:13:03.880
You like this kind of stuff?

00:13:03.880 --> 00:13:08.250
No one else wanted it, and I was
the only one to raise my hand.

00:13:08.550 --> 00:13:10.280
Do you not want to, Ryo-niichan?

00:13:10.280 --> 00:13:13.550
I'm not saying that, but this is for kids.

00:13:13.550 --> 00:13:15.650
I feel bad for Yamasaki-san.

00:13:16.120 --> 00:13:17.650
I don't mind.

00:13:19.430 --> 00:13:20.650
Then it's decided.

00:13:26.900 --> 00:13:28.500
What's the matter?

00:13:28.500 --> 00:13:30.270
Oh... nothing.

00:13:31.410 --> 00:13:35.100
Just wondering why he's sitting there alone.

00:13:38.480 --> 00:13:41.080
I don't really understand Ryo-niichan.

00:13:41.080 --> 00:13:42.170
I see...

00:14:02.000 --> 00:14:05.940
Can't you be more, like... enthusiastic?

00:14:05.940 --> 00:14:07.880
Maybe, uh, fool around by the water?

00:14:07.880 --> 00:14:10.910
This is what you wanted to show me?

00:14:10.910 --> 00:14:13.780
I thought you would like it.

00:14:14.620 --> 00:14:16.110
I don't think so.

00:14:17.590 --> 00:14:18.980
You like them, right?

00:14:19.320 --> 00:14:20.310
Dogs?

00:14:25.190 --> 00:14:28.590
The End

00:14:32.870 --> 00:14:34.440
That was good...

00:14:34.440 --> 00:14:35.700
Yeah.

00:14:49.350 --> 00:14:51.450
I didn't know.

00:14:51.450 --> 00:14:52.480
Huh?

00:14:52.890 --> 00:14:56.290
I didn't know Ryo-niichan had a soft-spot like that.

00:14:57.290 --> 00:14:59.620
We lived away from each other for a long time.

00:14:59.760 --> 00:15:00.730
I see.

00:15:00.730 --> 00:15:02.390
Yamasaki-san?

00:15:03.230 --> 00:15:06.030
Did something happen
between you and Ryo-niichan?

00:15:07.530 --> 00:15:09.930
The way you look at Ryo-niichan...

00:15:10.170 --> 00:15:12.970
is kind of scary.

00:15:16.440 --> 00:15:21.310
Is Ryo-niichan the reason you and
the person you loved got separated?

00:15:32.090 --> 00:15:33.150
Toma.

00:15:36.860 --> 00:15:38.060
Where did she go?

00:15:38.370 --> 00:15:40.130
I think she found him.

00:15:43.100 --> 00:15:44.630
The person she loved.

00:15:54.210 --> 00:15:56.080
I'll go look...

00:15:59.950 --> 00:16:01.220
I'll go.

00:16:05.030 --> 00:16:06.290
Oniichan...

00:16:15.770 --> 00:16:18.410
Then he asked...

00:16:18.410 --> 00:16:22.840
"How can you be so gentle and peaceful?"

00:16:22.840 --> 00:16:25.250
The girl answered,

00:16:25.250 --> 00:16:28.950
"I can hear the song."

00:16:28.950 --> 00:16:32.620
"How will I be able to hear the song, too?"

00:16:32.620 --> 00:16:34.880
"Just listen."

00:17:29.080 --> 00:17:34.450
Is it true policemen will kill people
to accomplish their missions?

00:17:36.050 --> 00:17:37.240
It's true.

00:17:38.850 --> 00:17:42.290
Then... have you also?

00:18:09.680 --> 00:18:10.840
Toma...

00:18:47.090 --> 00:18:48.150
Toma!

00:19:43.410 --> 00:19:45.210
Ryo-oniichan.

00:19:56.990 --> 00:19:58.250
Why?

00:20:03.100 --> 00:20:04.390
Take her home.

00:20:23.380 --> 00:20:25.150
Okay, got it.

00:20:25.720 --> 00:20:28.020
I'll eat something with Shin-niichan.

00:20:28.790 --> 00:20:30.950
Yeah, okay. Bye.

00:20:34.390 --> 00:20:35.990
I'm home.

00:20:37.100 --> 00:20:38.530
Welcome back.

00:21:07.460 --> 00:21:09.660
Sorry. It's your night off.

00:21:09.660 --> 00:21:11.030
It's fine.

00:21:11.030 --> 00:21:17.440
Anyway, tell me why you want to
reconfirm this body again so suddenly?

00:21:25.150 --> 00:21:28.620
I put him here so he'll be the
first in line for cremation.

00:21:28.620 --> 00:21:30.520
That's what you want, right?

00:21:32.450 --> 00:21:33.510
Yeah.

00:21:46.630 --> 00:21:53.570
Omotai kusariwo
The heavy chain

00:21:53.570 --> 00:21:59.650
ima hazushite agemashou
I will take it off for you

00:21:59.650 --> 00:22:04.450
jiyuuni naretara
Once you're free

00:22:04.450 --> 00:22:11.460
kokowo habataite yukeruwa
You'll be able to fly away

00:22:11.460 --> 00:22:18.200
atashiga samatage
I stood in your way

00:22:18.200 --> 00:22:27.010
ubatte kita madaminu sekai e
and took that world you haven't seen

00:22:27.010 --> 00:22:31.310
tamerau nonara
If you're going to hesitate

00:22:31.310 --> 00:22:39.990
huriharatte ageru sono udewo
I will free that arm for you

00:22:39.990 --> 00:22:44.520
soshite tookue
Then to faraway

00:22:44.520 --> 00:22:50.630
dekirudake tookue
As far away as possible

00:22:50.630 --> 00:22:53.870
aishiteruno
"I love you"

00:22:53.870 --> 00:22:57.600
ikanaideyo
"Don't leave me"

00:22:57.600 --> 00:23:04.410
koware chaukara
I will break

00:23:14.250 --> 00:23:16.960
A forbidden play.

00:23:16.960 --> 00:23:20.190
The dangerous twinges of ecstasy.

00:23:20.190 --> 00:23:23.030
Unstoppable trap.

00:23:23.960 --> 00:23:26.500
Shivering quietly.

00:23:26.500 --> 00:23:28.630
Drowning easily.

00:23:28.870 --> 00:23:31.300
Blinded in distress.

00:23:31.810 --> 00:23:34.970
The heart throbs in desire.

00:23:36.240 --> 00:23:38.840
An eternal impulse.

00:23:39.350 --> 00:23:41.640
A system that never fights back.
